ts & metadata secure in transit and at rest. In transit, screenshots & metadata are only accessible via TLS/SSL 1.3 or higher and at rest, screenshots & metadata are encrypted with AES256."}),(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsx)(__TURBOPACK__imported__module__807585__.IconSection,{className:"max-w-lg",icon:{component:PasswordIcon,position:"top",color:"text-sky-600"},heading:"Password Storage",text:"All passwords are one-way encrypted when stored in the database, and the database itself encrypted at rest, to ensure the original password can never be compromised."}),(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsx)(__TURBOPACK__imported__module__807585__.IconSection,{className:"max-w-lg",icon:{component:DatabaseIcon,position:"top",color:"text-sky-600"},heading:"Data Access",text:"Our people and systems can only access the data they need to do their job."}),(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsx)(__TURBOPACK__imported__module__807585__.IconSection,{className:"max-w-lg",icon:{component:__TURBOPACK__imported__module__913131__.CalendarCheckIcon,position:"top",color:"text-sky-600"},heading:"Staged Releases",text:"We only release software after qualifying it in development and staging environments. All customers can chose between 'stable' and 'latest' releases on a project or request bases. A minimum of 14 days notice is given before a 'latest' release is promoted to 'stable'."}),(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsx)(__TURBOPACK__imported__module__807585__.IconSection,{className:"max-w-lg",icon:{component:__TURBOPACK__imported__module__870457__.CodeIcon,position:"top",color:"text-sky-600"},heading:"Development Practice",text:"We peer review and test our code prior to release, including manual and automated checks for security issues."})]});__turbopack_context__.s(["__N_SSG",0,!0,"default",0,({screenshot})=>(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsxs)(__TURBOPACK__imported__module__190398__.Container,{title:"Security and Compliance",description